msgctxt "684_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

msgctxt "732_Tokita"
msgid "Are you still talking about that!? You gotta use your head more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he don't like this topic. Hope he didn't lose any motivation...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792_Tokita"
msgid "Wow... That's a pretty impressive analysis. I didn't expect to hear that from someone like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like that really boosted his motivation. Guess he likes this type o' conversation.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852_Tokita"
msgid "Well, that's interesting. But it doesn't have anything to do with fighting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=1
msgctxt "876_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

msgctxt "924_Tokita"
msgid "Wow! I didn't expect you to know about that! You're right－statistics and arithmetic are vital to efficient planning. Interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like that really boosted his motivation. Guess he likes this type o' conversation.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984_Tokita"
msgid "That's kids' stuff. I'm not interested in fiction. You should focus more on reality."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he don't like this topic. Hope he didn't lose any motivation...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044_Tokita"
msgid "I like things that have intrinsic beauty. But it's disappointing how the standard for what is considered \"art\" has lowered recently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=2
msgctxt "1068_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

msgctxt "1116_Tokita"
msgid "I see. Putting failures and negatives into consideration before making a move. That's a good point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like that really boosted his motivation. Guess he likes this type o' conversation.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176_Tokita"
msgid "I hate gambling, but I see it's not totally up to luck alone. So what should I do in order to win more efficiently? Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

msgctxt "1236_Tokita"
msgid "That's why you have it all wrong, Saejima-san! Ugh! That's just disgraceful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he don't like this topic. Hope he didn't lose any motivation...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=3
msgctxt "1260_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

msgctxt "1308_Tokita"
msgid "Um... Why are you talking about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1320_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he don't like this topic. Hope he didn't lose any motivation...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368_Tokita"
msgid "That's a wonderful concept. One must always think about reducing risk, and not just about pursuing returns."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like that really boosted his motivation. Guess he likes this type o' conversation.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428_Tokita"
msgid "The idea itself is a bit silly... But I guess that's important if you need to produce a large amount in a short time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1440_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=4
msgctxt "1452_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

msgctxt "1500_Tokita"
msgid "Sodachi-san, huh? Did he really learn fighting theory somewhere? I tell you, he's nothing more than comic relief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1512_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

msgctxt "1560_Tokita"
msgid "You want to talk about yourself...? Isn't that a bit self-absorbed? I don't think everyone cares about you that much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1572_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he don't like this topic. Hope he didn't lose any motivation...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620_Tokita"
msgid "Thanks for asking! My good looks are definitely what make me special. And, by good looks, I mean pure beauty, which is defined as... *blah* *blah*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1632_Saejima"
msgid "(That was one long story. But at least it looks like he's motivated now.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=5
msgctxt "1644_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

msgctxt "1692_Tokita"
msgid "Pure love... Sounds beautiful. But there've been many cases where relationships flag training efficiency, to a certain degree... *blah* *blah*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1704_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

msgctxt "1752_Tokita"
msgid "Cheating? The word itself is filthy! Just hearing it sends chills down my spine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1764_Tokita"
msgid "Dammit. That just soured my mood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1776_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he don't like this topic. Hope he didn't lose any motivation...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1824_Tokita"
msgid "You're better off without a girlfriend. You don't want to be led astray by immaterial things like love. It could lower your efficiency."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1836_Saejima"
msgid "(He's startin' to blabber... Guess he likes this kind o' topic.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1872_Tokita"
msgid "By the way... What do you think about the efficiency of your training?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1884_Saejima"
msgid "Efficiency?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1896_Tokita"
msgid "Yes. Training isn't about mindlessly performed hard work, and training based on spiritual teachings is the way of the past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1908_Tokita"
msgid "The amount of time allotted for training is limited. So, one must emphasize efficiency."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=6
msgctxt "1920_Tokita"
msgid "A calculated plan and a good training facility are all that matters when it comes to training a champion. Spirit doesn't matter, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1932_Saejima"
msgid "Exactly. Trainin' should always be based on efficiency."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1944_Tokita"
msgid "I know! I didn't know you felt the same way as I do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1956_Tokita"
msgid "But if that's the case, don't you think that there's too much useless content in my training menu? Give it some thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1968_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

msgctxt "1980_Saejima"
msgid "Spirit. That's what's most important. And plannin'? Well, I could give a rat's ass 'bout crap like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1992_Tokita"
msgid "Huh... I thought you would say that. You are one hardheaded old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2004_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he lost some trust in me...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2016_Saejima"
msgid "Don't know. I'd say both are important. Sure, efficiency's important, but yer ideas are too extreme."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2028_Tokita"
msgid "What do you mean!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2040_Saejima"
msgid "It ain't so black n' white."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2052_Saejima"
msgid "Regardless of how efficient a plan is, if you ain't motivated then you ain't gonna be able to concentrate on yer training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2064_Saejima"
msgid "Effective plannin's important, but it's motivation n' spirit that are behind implementin' any plan. Spirit's vital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2076_Tokita"
msgid "I guess there is some logic to what you're saying. That's not to say that I'm totally wrong, either, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2088_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like I convinced 'im. Guess I can sell a good answer every now n' then.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2100_Saejima"
msgid "So, I got a question for ya. You were at a different dojo before, right? How's that dojo compare to ours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2112_Tokita"
msgid "Hmmm... My older dojo had better facilities, and it was much better in terms of a track record, because it's been around for a long time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2124_Tokita"
msgid "But there were also a lot of guys there that I just couldn't stand. Sodachi Dojo is a more comfortable environment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2136_Saejima"
msgid "Guys ya couldn't stand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2148_Tokita"
msgid "Yeah. Just a bunch of dickheads that couldn't understand my talents. I got out of there because I couldn't stand being around them."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=7
msgctxt "2160_Tokita"
msgid "What would you have done if you were at a dojo with a bunch of asses like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2172_Saejima"
msgid "I woulda gone to a new dojo, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2184_Tokita"
msgid "Heheh. I know, right? I think that's the normal path to take. Looks like you do have some sense about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2196_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

msgctxt "2208_Saejima"
msgid "Who the fuck cares if they're asses? It don't matter. I'd of done nothin'. This sport's about facin' yerself, not a bunch o' low lives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2220_Tokita"
msgid "I was stupid to have asked the opinion of such a rude person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2232_Tokita"
msgid "I can't believe you... You don't even have an inkling of sensitivity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2244_Saejima"
msgid "(Did he lose trust in me...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2256_Saejima"
msgid "Well, I guess if I hated 'em that much I woulda chased 'em outta the dojo myself. No point in me being the one leavin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2268_Tokita"
msgid "That's the theory of a brave man. You know, there are lots of people in the world who don't have the strength to do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2280_Tokita"
msgid "But I guess that option never occurred to me... You definitely have a valid point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2292_Tokita"
msgid "Maybe I need to think more like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2304_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like I gave 'im a good answer. And he's motivated, too.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2316_Saejima"
msgid "By the way, you got a hobby or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2328_Tokita"
msgid "Hmph. Well, of course I do. I enjoy self-observation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2340_Saejima"
msgid "\"Self-observation\"? What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2352_Tokita"
msgid "Looking at myself in the mirror. And I'm usually totally naked, too. Becoming utterly absorbed in my own beauty makes me feel really good."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=8
msgctxt "2364_Tokita"
msgid "I often do it after training or taking a bath. Do you ever do it? Heheh... Who am I kidding? Of course you don't! Heheheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2376_Saejima"
msgid "Are ya serious? I never do it. Ain't it creepy for a guy like me to be checkin' himself out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2388_Tokita"
msgid "Heheh... True, it would be pretty creepy for an old man like you to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2400_Tokita"
msgid "I guess it's only meant for handsome guys like me. Heheheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2412_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess we had a good talk.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2424_Saejima"
msgid "I do that everyday. Coincidence, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2436_Tokita"
msgid "Whaaaaaat!? You know, I was just asking as a joke... Are you being serious!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2448_Tokita"
msgid "Ugh... Just thinking about that makes me feel sick... I definitely shouldn't have asked..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2460_Saejima"
msgid "(I ain't sure what just happened, but it looks like I offended 'im...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2472_Saejima"
msgid "Not me. But maybe I'll try it if it's that good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2484_Tokita"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "2496_Saejima"
msgid "What? What is it? Are ya tryin' to say that me checkin' myself out is a joke?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2508_Tokita"
msgid "Noooo! Not at all! Heheh! You should definitely try it! Yeah! Hahaha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2520_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

msgctxt "2532_Saejima"
msgid "So, have ya gotten used to the dojo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2544_Tokita"
msgid "My other dojo was full of guys I didn't like, so it was really stressful being there. But that's not the case here, so I guess I can train comfortably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2556_Saejima"
msgid "Heh... Sodachi, Sugiyama, Fukushi. They're all a bit weird, but they ain't bad guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2568_Tokita"
msgid "Yeah... You know, if I keep going at it like this, I get the feeling that I'm going to get too good...! It's a scary feeling..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2580_Saejima"
msgid "Hm? What's that supposed to mean? Ain't it a good thing to get strong? What's so scary 'bout that, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2592_Tokita"
msgid "Because! If a handsome guy like me becomes number one in fighting, there wouldn't be anything else for me to strive towards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2604_Tokita"
msgid "See, I'm the most attractive fighter out there right now. So what would happen if I became the strongest fighter, too?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=9
msgctxt "2616_Tokita"
msgid "Where should I set the bar? What is my goal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2628_Saejima"
msgid "Cross that bridge when ya get to it. Humans are the personification o' greed. You'll find a goal in due time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2640_Tokita"
msgid "Oh, come on already! You can't keep spitting out such unreasonable logic! You have to think in advance and plan things out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2652_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like I gave 'im a bad impression...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2664_Saejima"
msgid "There ain't no problem with livin' without a goal. You should just enjoy livin' as a handsome champion. That's a rare opportunity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2676_Tokita"
msgid "Well, I guess you're right. But I just feel bad for the poor saps around me. I mean, I'll be the best looking <Italic>and</Italic> the strongest... Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2688_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2700_Saejima"
msgid "Then I'll be the hurdle ya gotta pass. No matter how strong ya get, I'll always be a step above ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2712_Tokita"
msgid "Heh... You should be a comedian. Even if you were able to become stronger than me, I would just become even stronger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2724_Saejima"
msgid "Heheh... Let's save this conversation for when ya actually do become stronger than me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2736_Tokita"
msgid "Heheh. You'll see. I'll pass you sooner than later, and make you regret what you just said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2748_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like I got 'im motivated... That's good.)"
msgstr ""

